{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言いたくなるぅ～～～！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様、昨日はいつになく弱気なブログでごめんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10年に一度の弱音吐かせていただきました！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の記事のコメント、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"涙でにじんで画面がよく見えなくなっちゃうくらい泣きながら読ませてもらいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんはあれですね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私より私のことをよくわかってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やはり皆様は私にとってかけがえのない存在です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それを再確認させていただきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條にしてはかなりらしくないブログがアップされてて驚かれた方や、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっべー明日個別握手会だけどこんな状態で能條と何話しゃあいいんだこりゃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って方がたくさんいたかと思います（；＿；）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あああーごめんなさいっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様は謝らなくていいって言ってくれるんだけど、やはり謝らせてください。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......大丈夫ですっっ！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこにいようが愛未は愛未！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんというたくさんの素敵な味方がいてくれるかぎり私は何があっても大丈夫。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は私ものすっごい負けず嫌いなんですよね。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここで発揮しなくてどうする(^_-)？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"負けてたまるか(^_-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほーら愛未はいつだってスマイルだもん！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/10/12/8154080/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから明日はなーんにも考えず最高に楽しい握手にしましょ？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会ブースで皆さんをを心よりお待ちしております！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次回は\n代々木の裏話レポなど明日の握手のこと、書かせていただきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おたのしみにー＼(^o^)／"}],"source":"archive"}